        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So…you look at your weaponry total, and compare that to their shield total, then subtract the shields from the weapons and if there is any damage left over you then  remove  that many shields (and carry over into weaponry if there is damage left over after the shields have gone)?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yup. Weapons - Shields = Energy removed (starting with shields then weaponry)</p>",
