        "cooked": "<p>Okay. We just missed out the \"deduct damage equal to your shields before removing shields\" bit. Still, if that's the <span class=\"bbcode-i\">only</span> thing we got wrong, that's not bad for a first game ;).</p>\n<p>One other thing I didn't know about was the meanings of the symbols on the Station cards, as that wasn't mentioned in the rulebook anywhere (unless I missed it), but since reading on here I now know it's a means of telling what's gonna come up if the Opposition flips that card during the Aftermath phase.</p>",
